### Create an invite (OWNER). role EDITOR or VIEWER, expiresAt in the future
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/invites
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "role": "EDITOR", "maxUses": 5, "expiresAt": "2026-12-31T00:00:00Z" }

### List invites with usage (OWNER)
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revoke
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/invites/BALI-XXXX
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Preview an invite. Public: no token needed. 410 INVITE_REVOKED / INVITE_EXPIRED, 409 INVITE_FULL
GET {{host}}/invites/BALI-XXXX

### Accept. 409 ALREADY_MEMBER if you are in the trip
POST {{host}}/invites/BALI-XXXX/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Members (emails only for the OWNER)
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change role (OWNER). The id is a member id (trip_members.id), not a user id
PATCH {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/members/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "role": "VIEWER" }

### Remove a member (OWNER). Their expenses stay.
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/members/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leave the trip (not the OWNER: 409 OWNER_CANNOT_LEAVE)
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transfer ownership (OWNER; the old owner becomes EDITOR) -> 204
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/transfer-ownership
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "newOwnerUserId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }


### Add a person without an account (OWNER). The phone is optional; the OWNER sees it as digits with the country code
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/members
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111", "displayName": "Rina", "phone": "0812-3456-7890" }

### "Kamu yang mana?": take over a member added by name -> 204. 409 MEMBER_ALREADY_CLAIMED / MEMBER_HAS_ACCOUNT
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/members/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Undo a claim (OWNER) -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/members/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comments on an itinerary item (or targetKind=EXPENSE)
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/comments?targetKind=ITINERARY_ITEM&targetId=22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/comments/counts?targetKind=ITINERARY_ITEM
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/trips/{{tripId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "id": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333", "targetKind": "ITINERARY_ITEM", "targetId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222", "body": "@Rina berangkat jam 8 ya", "mentions": ["11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111"] }

### Edit or delete your own comment
PATCH {{host}}/comments/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "body": "Berangkat jam 8.", "mentions": [] }

###
DELETE {{host}}/comments/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
